"GFX12.5 additionally introduces new barrier *objects* that offer more "
"flexibility for synchronizing the execution of a subset of waves of a "
"workgroup, or synchronizing execution across workgroups within a workgroup "
"cluster, via ``s_barrier``."
msgstr ""

