#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:339
msgid ""
"*Drops* the barrier *object* ``BO`` if and only if there is a barrier *join* "
"``J`` such that ``J`` is *barrier-joined-before* this barrier *drop* "
"operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:0
msgid "``s_barrier_signal <N>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:0
msgid "Or"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:0
msgid "``s_barrier_signal_isfirst <N>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:354
msgid ""
"``<N>`` is an immediate constant, or stored in bits ``[4:0]`` of ``m0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:355
msgid ""
"The ``_isfirst`` variant sets ``SCC=1`` if this wave is the first to signal "
"the barrier, otherwise ``SCC=0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:357
msgid ""
"For barrier *objects* ``[1, 16]``: When using ``m0`` as an operand, if there "
"is a non-zero value contained in the bits ``[22:16]`` of ``m0``, the "
"*expected count* of the barrier *object* is set to that value before the "
"*arrive count* of the barrier *object* is incremented. The new *expected "
"count* value must be greater than or equal to the *arrive count*, otherwise "
"the behavior is undefined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:363
msgid ""
"For barrier *objects* ``-4`` and ``-3`` (``cluster`` barriers): only one "
"wave per workgroup may arrive at the barrier on behalf of its entire "
"workgroup. However, any wave within the workgroup cluster can then *wait* on "
"this barrier *object*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:368
#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:380
msgid ""
"This is a no-op on the *NULL named barrier object* (barrier *object* ``0``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:371
msgid "``s_barrier_wait <N>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:373
msgid "``<N>`` is an immediate constant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:374
msgid ""
"For barrier *objects* ``-2`` and ``-1``: This instruction cannot complete "
"before all waves of the workgroup have launched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:377
msgid ""
"For barrier *objects* ``-4`` and ``-3`` (``cluster`` barriers): This "
"instruction cannot complete before all waves of the workgroup cluster have "
"launched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.rst:382
msgid ""
"For *named barrier objects*, this instruction always waits on the last "
"*named barrier object* that the thread has *joined*, even if it is different "
"from the *barrier object* passed to the instruction."
msgstr ""

